{
  "_doc": "Budgets for tools/assetcheck.py (docs/STUDIO_PIPELINE.md). First matching glob wins. Set 2026-10-20 at each class's current maximum + ~10% to stop growth; lower them as the optimisation rounds land. Raise one only on purpose, in the same commit as the model.",
